WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:02,270
Everyone didn't leave the classroom last night

2
00:00:02,270 --> 00:00:05,770
So there are only three of them, Lin Yang

3
00:00:05,770 --> 00:00:08,070
You are avenging a private vendetta, what nonsense are you talking about?

4
00:00:08,070 --> 00:00:09,270
I am not a great man

5
00:00:09,270 --> 00:00:10,570
I slept all night last night

6
00:00:10,570 --> 00:00:12,270
Both of them can testify

7
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:16,570
I know it's not you

8
00:00:16,570 --> 00:00:18,870
You have done more than anyone else

9
00:00:18,870 --> 00:00:21,470
You can't be a great man

10
00:00:21,470 --> 00:00:24,200
So who is the great man among these two people?

11
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:27,380
Or should we say they are all great men?

12
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:29,180
Not only one

13
00:00:29,180 --> 00:00:30,180
why

14
00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:31,860
The radio said

15
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:34,520
When there are more great people than ordinary people

16
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:37,120
They will not enter the killing state in Weizhuang

17
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:39,030
There are three of them

18
00:00:39,030 --> 00:00:41,030
If two of them are great men

19
00:00:41,030 --> 00:00:43,130
Zhang Hao died last night

20
00:00:43,130 --> 00:00:48,200
So there is at most one

21
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:53,090
Then how to find out the last great man and so on?

22
00:00:53,090 --> 00:00:55,090
Can we find great men by waiting?
